# DS-8 probe, an IC Housing: a dial's Mode as its top, and a Setting
# written past it. One Dial and one modular Dial on the network.
# Once at the start: Mode 17, then Setting 25.
# Dial: r0 Setting, r2 Mode. Modular Dial: r1 Setting, r3 Mode.
sb HASH("StructureLogicDial") Mode 17
sb HASH("ModularDeviceDial") Mode 17
sb HASH("StructureLogicDial") Setting 25
sb HASH("ModularDeviceDial") Setting 25
main:
yield
lb r0 HASH("StructureLogicDial") Setting Sum
lb r1 HASH("ModularDeviceDial") Setting Sum
lb r2 HASH("StructureLogicDial") Mode Sum
lb r3 HASH("ModularDeviceDial") Mode Sum
j main
